  "releaseNotes": "RunLog 3.1.0 Release Notes\n      New Features:\n      * Added Warning method overloads that accept exceptions in both Log and Logger classes\n      * Added Logger.Warning(Exception exception, string messageTemplate, params object[] propertyValues)\n      * Added Log.Warning(Exception exception, string messageTemplate, params object[] propertyValues)\n      * Completed exception handling methods across all log levels (Verbose, Debug, Information, Warning, Error, Fatal)\n      Compatible:\n\n      Maintains compatibility with .NET Framework 4.7.2\n      Backward compatible with all previous 3.x versions",
